
Use the runbook as the execution checklist. Complete each phase in sequence and do not move to the next phase until the expected output has been validated.
At each phase, capture the validation result and any exceptions so the final model has a traceable implementation and testing history.

Phase
Power BI action
Expected output
1. Connect
