Interactive report
6. Secure
Create RLS role + mapping
Enterprise-level security
7. Validate
Reconcile with Snowflake
Trusted numbers
8. Publish
Workspace + refresh + permissions
Production-ready semantic model/report

 
 
The implementation is complete when the model and report have passed reconciliation and security testing, business stakeholders have approved the KPIs, operational settings are configured, and the required documentation and deliverables are available to the support team.
